&lt;h2 id="setup"&gt;
 Setup
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#setup"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Follow &lt;a href="https://documentation.ubuntu.com/charmed-kubeflow/tutorial/get-started/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;this&lt;/a&gt; to start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic 3 big steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;install microk8s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;install/config juju.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;config charmed kubeflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id="access-dashboard-to-start"&gt;
 Access dashboard to start
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#access-dashboard-to-start"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;microk8s kubectl -n kubeflow get svc istio-ingressgateway-workload -o jsonpath='{.status.loadBalancer.ingress[0].ip}'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="clean-up"&gt;
 Clean up
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#clean-up"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Destroy juju models/controllers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;juju destroy-model &amp;lt;your-model&amp;gt; &lt;span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic"&gt;# kubeflow&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;juju destroy-controller &amp;lt;your-controller&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol start="2"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reset microk8s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;microk8s reset
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="some-references"&gt;
 Some references
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#some-references"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This &lt;a href="https://anaisurl.com/kubernetes-kubectl-microk8s/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;post&lt;/a&gt; described how to use generic kubectl on top of microk8s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://canonical.com/microk8s/docs/addon-gpu" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;How&lt;/a&gt; to enable gpu.&lt;/li&gt;
